f6402e-abc9-428a-869f-208a1e8831c0","Title":"UNFPA partners Lagos, GoMed to expand reproductive health services for Nigerian students","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u00221074\u0022 height=\u0022598\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?fit=1074%2C598\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022University of Lagos (UNILAG).\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?w=1074\u0026amp;ssl=1 1074w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?resize=526%2C293\u0026amp;ssl=1 526w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?resize=768%2C428\u0026amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?resize=150%2C84\u0026amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2024/01/University-of-Lagos-UNILAG-1.jpg?resize=750%2C418\u0026amp;ssl=1 750w\u0022 sizes=\u0022(max-width: 1074px) 100vw, 1074px\u0022 /\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThrough the platform, students will have access to discounted health products and discreet delivery to campuses and student hostels.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe post \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/more-news/901013-unfpa-partners-lagos-gomed-to-expand-reproductive-health-services-for-nigerian-students.html\u0022\u003EUNFPA partners Lagos, GoMed to expand reproductive health services for Nigerian students\u003C/a\u003E appeared first on \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com\u0022\u003EPremium Times Nigeria\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n","Url":"https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/more-news/901013-unfpa-partners-lagos-gomed-to-expand-reproductive-health-services-for-nigerian-students.html","ImageUrl":null,"Category":"Technology","PublishedAt":"2026-08-06T08:27:07Z","Source":"Premium Times"},{"Id":"3ac8f967-6460-4d17-b52f-53c74690aa73","Title":"Nairobi reflections (1): Reclaiming Africa\u2019s leadership philosophy, By Olumide Frederick Adetiba","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u0022800\u0022 height=\u0022533\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/11/Olumide-Fred-Adetiba.jpg?fit=800%2C533\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022Olumide Fred\u0026#039; Adetiba\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/11/Olumide-Fred-Adetiba.jpg?w=800\u0026amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/11/Olumide-Fred-Adetiba.jpg?resize=524%2C349\u0026amp;ssl=1 524w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/11/Olumide-Fred-Adetiba.jpg?resize=768%2C512\u0026amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/11/Olumide-Fred-Adetiba.jpg?resize=750%2C500\u0026amp;ssl=1 750w\u0022 sizes=\u0022(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\u0022 /\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAs someone whose work sits at the intersection of faith, leadership, governance, and development, I have become increasingly convinced that Africa\u0026#8217;s greatest challenge is not merely a shortage of resources or opportunities. Rather, it is the absence of sound, progressive, and values-driven philosophies capable of shaping leaders, strengthening institutions, and driving sustainable development. \u00A0Every society [\u0026#8230;]\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe post \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/901016-nairobi-reflections-1-reclaiming-africas-leadership-philosophy-by-olumide-frederick-adetiba.html\u0022\u003ENairobi reflections (1): Reclaiming Africa\u0026#8217;s leadership philosophy, By Olumide Frederick Adetiba\u003C/a\u003E appeared first on \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com\u0022\u003EPremium Times Nigeria\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n","Url":"https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/901016-nairobi-reflections-1-reclaiming-africas-leadership-philosophy-by-olumide-frederick-adetiba.html","ImageUrl":null,"Category":"Technology","PublishedAt":"2026-08-06T08:22:46Z","Source":"Premium Times"},{"Id":"5b89667a-ef16-42b7-b6a7-3089b49da455","Title":"Oriire and the 9/11 standard: Why the Oyo commission deserves an open mind, By Oludare Ogunlana","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u0022614\u0022 height=\u0022640\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/12/Oludare-Ogunlana.jpg?fit=614%2C640\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/12/Oludare-Ogunlana.jpg?w=614\u0026amp;ssl=1 614w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/12/Oludare-Ogunlana.jpg?resize=335%2C349\u0026amp;ssl=1 335w\u0022 sizes=\u0022(max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px\u0022 /\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis is why the commission matters, and why it deserves better than cynicism. First, it is our instrument of truth. Like the 9/11 Commission, its assignment is to establish what truly happened: how the attackers gathered, moved, and struck; what warnings existed and where they died; how the response was organised; and why 56 days [\u0026#8230;]\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe post \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/901012-oriire-and-the-9-11-standard-why-the-oyo-commission-deserves-an-open-mind-by-oludare-ogunlana.html\u0022\u003EOriire and the 9/11 standard: Why the Oyo commission deserves an open mind, By Oludare Ogunlana\u003C/a\u003E appeared first on \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com\u0022\u003EPremium Times Nigeria\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n","Url":"https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/901012-oriire-and-the-9-11-standard-why-the-oyo-commission-deserves-an-open-mind-by-oludare-ogunlana.html","ImageUrl":null,"Category":"Technology","PublishedAt":"2026-08-06T08:16:32Z","Source":"Premium Times"},{"Id":"086a32e0-220c-40a4-9aa8-9d08fb88ec76","Title":"A bond that must never be broken (4), By Femi Fani-Kayode","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u0022604\u0022 height=\u0022498\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/02/Femi-Fani-Kayode.jpeg?fit=604%2C498\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/02/Femi-Fani-Kayode.jpeg?w=604\u0026amp;ssl=1 604w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/02/Femi-Fani-Kayode.jpeg?resize=423%2C349\u0026amp;ssl=1 423w\u0022 sizes=\u0022(max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\u0022 /\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWho are these dangerous, violent and subversive elements that thrive on targeting and terrorising the weakest and most vulnerable Africans in their country and that make the old Ku Klux Klan of America, the old National Front of the UK, the old Hitler Youth, Brown Shirts of Nazi Germany, and the old Afrikaner Resistance Movement [\u0026#8230;]\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe post \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/900973-a-bond-that-must-never-be-broken-4-by-femi-fani-kayode.html\u0022\u003EA bond that must never be broken (4), By Femi Fani-Kayode\u003C/a\u003E appeared first on \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com\u0022\u003EPremium Times Nigeria\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n","Url":"https://www.premiumtimesng.com/opinion/900973-a-bond-that-must-never-be-broken-4-by-femi-fani-kayode.html","ImageUrl":null,"Category":"Technology","PublishedAt":"2026-08-06T07:41:18Z","Source":"Premium Times"},{"Id":"1dfa7f4f-1625-444a-a5e7-50d28874725c","Title":"Osun Election: \u201CPrepare to employ your uncle\u201D \u2014 Uzodimma replies Davido","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u00221672\u0022 height=\u0022941\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?fit=1672%2C941\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022Imo State Governor Hope Uzodimma and Afrobeats star David \u201CDavido\u201D Adeleke\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?w=1672\u0026amp;ssl=1 1672w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?resize=526%2C296\u0026amp;ssl=1 526w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?resize=768%2C432\u0026amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?resize=1536%2C864\u0026amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?resize=750%2C422\u0026amp;ssl=1 750w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2026/08/david.png?resize=1140%2C642\u0026amp;ssl=1 1140w\u0022 sizes=\u0022(max-width: 1672px) 100vw, 1672px\u0022 /\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMr Uzodinma, who chairs the APC National Campaign Council for the Osun governorship election, responded after Davido appealed to an unnamed politician from Imo State to allow Osun residents to choose their next governor freely.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe post \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/901004-osun-election-prepare-to-employ-your-uncle-uzodimma-replies-davido.html\u0022\u003EOsun Election:\u00A0 \u201CPrepare to employ your uncle\u201D \u2014 Uzodimma replies Davido\u00A0\u003C/a\u003E appeared first on \u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.premiumtimesng.com\u0022\u003EPremium Times Nigeria\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n","Url":"https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/901004-osun-election-prepare-to-employ-your-uncle-uzodimma-replies-davido.html","ImageUrl":null,"Category":"Politics","PublishedAt":"2026-08-06T07:22:35Z","Source":"Premium Times"},{"Id":"97112f63-7b9f-471c-ab7e-23f9525a6d63","Title":"Abuja Earth Tremor: Alake calls for calm, directs agency to report updates","Summary":"\u003Cimg width=\u00221573\u0022 height=\u0022984\u0022 src=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?fit=1573%2C984\u0026amp;ssl=1\u0022 class=\u0022webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\u0022 alt=\u0022minister of solid minerals development, Dele Alake.\u0022 style=\u0022display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;max-width: 100%;\u0022 link_thumbnail=\u0022\u0022 decoding=\u0022async\u0022 srcset=\u0022https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?w=1573\u0026amp;ssl=1 1573w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?resize=526%2C329\u0026amp;ssl=1 526w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?resize=768%2C480\u0026amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?resize=1536%2C961\u0026amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-content/files/2025/10/GrgfPWoXgAA1ir5-e1761570050685.jpeg?resize=750%2C469\u0026amp;ssl=1 750w, https://i0.wp.com/media.premiumtimesng.com/wp-con